  "notes": "The stable gemini-2.5-flash of 2025-06-17 is the 05-20 preview without changes (developer blog). The 04-17 preview was to be turned off on 2025-07-15; the 05-20 preview had its shutdown announced for 2025-11-18, and the 09-2025 preview was shut down on 2026-02-17 (the release notes and deprecations page list it as gemini-2.5-flash-preview-09-25, kept as an alias). Google said the 09-2025 preview was not intended to become a new stable version, so it is kept as an alias and milestone, not as a separate record. Gemini 2.5 Flash Image, Live and TTS models share the name stem but are separate models and not recorded here. Vertex AI is counted as Google's own API (api)."
